# Potential Obfuscated Ordinal Call Via Rundll32 | T1027.010 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_rundll32_obfuscated_ordinal_call.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image="*\\rundll32.exe" OR OriginalFileName="RUNDLL32.EXE" OR CommandLine="*rundll32*") (CommandLine IN ("*#+*", "*#-*", "*#0*", "*#655*", "*#656*"))
